# 📖 About

This repository documents my complete journey toward becoming a Machine Learning Engineer.

The repository contains structured learning materials, hands-on notebooks, data preprocessing techniques, feature engineering, supervised and unsupervised learning algorithms, deep learning fundamentals, and real-world machine learning projects.

The goal is not only to learn machine learning algorithms but also to understand how they are applied in production-level AI systems.

